<text x="64" y="316" fill="#f8fafc" font-size="28" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Hallazgos iniciales</text>
<text x="64" y="372" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="24" font-family="Arial">- Bug: buscar() retorna null con orElse(null)</text>
